00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.060
But the other guy, just, like, I don't want to hang out with a guy that's just, like,

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:46.800
just, like, packed with ammo and guns and just, like, heavy artillery all the time.

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:48.460
