00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:04.840
Like, we're just supposed to believe that they're not taking performance-enhancing drugs.

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:07.800
They're always on cocaine.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:14.300
Duke is also the guy, you know, that I would think, you know, like, okay, sure, his name's Duke, fine,

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.900
but he could have also just been named G.I.

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:18.000
Joe. That's G.I.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.020
Joe right there. Right.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:23.220
That's G.I. Joe, you know, and it's like, I get why there isn't a character named G.I.

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:28.100
Joe, but it's also, like, it's free money in the future if they ever want to just make a character

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:29.380
who's the name of the brand.

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:30.900
Yeah, it's like the prequel.

